  <!--
    Firewall rules in both stores. The rules under <filter> are the ones the
    legacy pages write. The rules under <OPNsense><Firewall><Filter><rules>
    are the ones the "Rules [new]" page of 26.1 and the rules page of 26.7
    write, and the 26.7 default config ships; OPNsense loads both. The second
    set is deliberately out of <sequence> order and holds an empty <rule/>.

    The file is a composite of the rule bodies those releases write: most rules
    have the 26.7.4 and later body, the sequence 800 rule the 26.1.2 to 26.7.1
    body, and the sequence 900 rule the reduced body of the factory default,
    which has no uuid. A real export holds one body, because a save rewrites
    every rule, and carries persisted_at and description attributes on
    <Filter>.
  -->
